Open Git Bash this directory and run command below:
openssl genpkey -algorithm RSA -pkeyopt rsa_keygen_bits:2048 -out private_pkcs1.pem
openssl pkcs8 -topk8 -inform PEM -outform PEM -in private_pkcs1.pem -out private.pem -nocrypt
openssl rsa -in private_pkcs1.pem -pubout -out public.pem
rm private_pkcs1.pem

After that, this folder should contain 2 files named: private.pem and public.pem having below format:

----- BEGIN PUBLIC/PRIVATE KEY -----
blahblahblah content
----- END PUBLIC/PRIVATE KEY -----

Done!